ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  You always need a 5+ card suit to transfer^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  Be conservative with an 8-card and aggressive with a 9-card fit^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  K9875 is not considered a sequence^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  A missed slam^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Don't lead away from aces in suits contract^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  You are not the only player mis-discarding^*N|


