mb|P|mb|P|mb|1D|mb|P|mb|1H|mb|P?|mb|1S|mb|P?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|lb|*bSelect the best Bid for East.^^4S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@S is a pretty weak bid for the hand. West has no idea how strong East is. So East must raise spades to the appropriate number to show her strength. 2@S would show a minimum hand (6-9 or so), 3@S would show an invitational hand (10-12) and 4@S an opener 13+.|
