nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I wouldn't mind 3@S that I think is a little conservative with 5 little hearts and known 8 card fit which always makes you more conservative. You should be conservative with an 8 card fit and aggressive with a 9 card fit. With all those consideration I still think 4@S better than 3@S.|
