mb|1C|mb|1S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|1@S by East promises 5 spades so that is not a good bid. All overcalls promise 5 card suits so 1@D has the same problem as 1@S. East should either make a takeout double (my choice) or pass.|
