nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|If North had opened a major, the takeout double tends to show 4 cards in the other major and if you don't have 4 cards in the other major, although sometimes you are stuck, you should be more reluctant to make a takeout double. |
PG| ***** 81 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|But when North opens 1 of a minor, quite often the takeout doubler will be 4-3 in the majors.|
PG| ***** 82 ***** |


